{"c":[{"id":"e7d7ded421a71b5d","sum":"B25/W4: never-typed kinds live only in memory/sensitive.ts (extend it, no second list). HSTS-preloaded captcha hosts can't be pointed at a local server; test captcha frames via extension/src/worker/compose.ts unit tests.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T211051Z-bc8230171f42cb4e","text":"B25: never-typed kinds (fill, planner, Ask) are memory/sensitive.ts, M1's classifier copied unchanged from v2/memory; extend that file, never a second list.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T220624Z-f865060dd10d04a3","text":"W4: hcaptcha/recaptcha hosts are HSTS-preloaded, so --host-resolver-rules cannot point a test browser's captcha frame at a local http server (the load hangs); test captcha frame composition through extension/src/worker/compose.ts unit tests instead.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1c32ace5fe4e098f","sum":"W4/B26: bridge test sockets a fixture accept()s need SO_NOSIGPIPE or signal 13 kills the run. Groq answers a one-token probe after a model's daily tokens run out; only a real-size request shows the 429.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261004T223033Z-e64c70b59e406a7f","text":"W4: Swift Testing runs bridge tests in one process; a test socket that a fixture accept()s needs SO_NOSIGPIPE, or a write after the peer closed kills the whole run with signal 13, blamed on whichever test was running.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T224111Z-04a43869ad872043","text":"B26: Groq answers a one-token probe even when a model's tokens-per-day is spent; only a real-size request shows the 429 TPD. gpt-oss-120b's day ran out during B26's first Ask run.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
